-- Boca Raton (Levis JCC + Mahj on the Beach + 5 sessions) and Palm Beach Gardens (Palm Beach Mahjong + 5 sessions) now have five or more active rows: published with intros.
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'In Boca Raton, the Levis JCC''s Phyllis & Harvey Sandler Center runs beginner Mah Jongg lessons on Monday and Wednesday mornings in two-week sessions, and students bring a 2026 National Mah Jongg card. Mahj on the Beach, led by Kari Long, teaches American mahjong lessons and hosts open play, often at the Schmidt Boca Raton History Museum. Sessions fill up, so book ahead. If you have never played, the Levis JCC beginner class is the easiest way in.', "updatedAt" = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE "slug" = 'boca-raton' AND "published" = 0;
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'In Palm Beach Gardens, Palm Beach Mahjong hosts American mahjong at restaurants and local venues, from PGA National and brunch spots to a preservation foundation, with an elevated introduction to the game for beginners and regular open play. Sessions are small and social, so booking ahead helps, and the booking page lists the next date and the venue. If you are new, book an introduction before joining open play.', "updatedAt" = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE "slug" = 'palm-beach-gardens' AND "published" = 0;
